msgstr "Your email is used only for account verification and for recovering your ID or password. We will not use it for anything else, and we will never send you unsolicited mail. No marketing email, of course."

msgid "이미 계정이 있으신가요?"
msgstr "Already have an account?"

msgid "이미 다른 계정이 쓰고 있는 이메일입니다."
